{
  "name": "Validate, enrich, and route inbound leads from a form with LeadMagic",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Inbound lead router\n\n### How it works\n1. A hosted n8n form collects name, work email, and company website.\n2. The email is validated; invalid addresses are dropped.\n3. The company is enriched from its website domain.\n4. Companies above your headcount threshold alert sales in Slack; everyone else goes to a nurture sheet.\n\n### Setup\n1. Open **Lead form** and copy its production URL (or embed it).\n2. Set the threshold in **Big enough for sales?**.\n3. Pick a Slack channel and paste a sheet URL.\n4. Select your LeadMagic, Slack, and Google Sheets credentials.\n\n### Customization\nSwap the form for a Webhook to accept leads from your site or ads. Add **Find Mobile** on the sales branch for fast follow-up.\n\nRequires the [LeadMagic community node](https://github.com/LeadMagic/leadmagic-n8n#install) (`n8n-nodes-leadmagic`). Tested with n8n 2.47 and n8n-nodes-leadmagic 1.8.0.",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "0f8976d9-85ba-58cf-a70a-49c49c770382",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Talk to sales",
        "formDescription": "We'll get back to you within one business day.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Name",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Work Email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Company Website",
              "placeholder": "example.com",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e8b28391-04f1-591a-973c-5fc73f73cda5",
      "name": "Lead form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "email",
        "operation": "validateEmail",
        "inputMode": "single",
        "email": "={{ $json['Work Email'] }}",
        "outputMode": "selected",
        "outputFields": [
          "email_status"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2799a242-e8b4-577f-a915-4077abfa77de",
      "name": "Validate email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 4
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.email_status }}",
              "rightValue": "invalid",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "fd5e1bee-3f8f-5ccc-829e-81070a870d3d",
      "name": "Deliverable?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "company",
        "operation": "searchCompany",
        "company_domain": "={{ $('Lead form').item.json['Company Website'].replace(/^https?:\\/\\/(www\\.)?/, '').split('/')[0] }}",
        "outputMode": "selected",
        "outputFields": [
          "companyName",
          "industry",
          "employeeCount",
          "websiteUrl"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3dfd0394-5b5a-5169-83e1-925457f1e3c9",
      "name": "Enrich company",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 4
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ Number($json.employeeCount ?? 0) }}",
              "rightValue": 50,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "16a1502e-ff5d-5c45-8c6d-a08cf41c23d1",
      "name": "Big enough for sales?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "text": "=:fire: New inbound lead: *{{ $('Lead form').item.json.Name }}* ({{ $('Lead form').item.json['Work Email'] }})\n{{ $json.companyName }} · {{ $json.industry }} · {{ $json.employeeCount }} employees",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "0c6796fa-fa2e-5d01-aa5e-f838821211b1",
      "name": "Alert sales",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        1100,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "url"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gid=0",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Sheet1"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Name": "={{ $('Lead form').item.json.Name }}",
            "Email": "={{ $('Lead form').item.json['Work Email'] }}",
            "Company": "={{ $json.companyName }}",
            "Employees": "={{ $json.employeeCount }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ae9d6316-1336-59ea-89ad-2a7de48f414b",
      "name": "Add to nurture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        1100,
        120
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
